# DB dumps — NEVER commit raw production data.
# The live dump sits at <honeycomb-root>/backups/ and is already ignored by
# the enclosing repo's .gitignore. This entry is defence-in-depth for the day
# REBELUTION.fund/ becomes its own repo.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
backups/

